        "body": "This is a port of #2248.\r\n\r\nOnly difference are:\r\n\r\n- added variable to determine which UI is used as the buffer limit is currently UI dependent, separate variables for the UIs\r\n- added constant for limit of hits to be delivered to GA in each batch and a comment to explain why that limit was chosen.\r\n\r\nAlso removed now redundant class, `GoogleRecorderEventListener` and updated all references accordingly.\r\n\r\nThanks again to @KingKrimmson for this PR.",
